at%20are%20the%20best%20options%20right%20now%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask MPE on WhatsApp</a></div><style>.mpe-tip{border:1px solid #efe0d5;border-left:3px solid #a64e2e;border-radius:12px;background:#fbf6f1;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0}.mpe-tip-lbl{display:inline-block;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a64e2e;margin-bottom:7px}.mpe-tip-head{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;color:#1f1e1d;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:5px}.mpe-tip-body{font-size:.9rem;color:#5f5b54;line-height:1.6}.mpe-tip-body a{color:#a64e2e;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:2px}.mpe-tip-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:11px;background:#157347;color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 15px;border-radius:9px}</style></div><div class="tab-panel" id="panel-description"><section class="proj-section"><h2>Building description</h2><div class="desc-section"><h3>Building details</h3><div class="desc-body collapsed" id="desc-main">
 Garden Grove is a 21 storied Ready Possession Project and the location is Shimpoli Road, Off Link Road, Kanti Park, Borivali West and is developed by Kamala Group.
Garden Grove is tagged as Investors Delight / Self Use.
Kamala Group also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Holly Hock, Rose Queen, Jai Shankar Deep, Kamala Natraj, Sant Sudama, Nav Bahar, Kaniya Kutir, Khandelwal, Nutan Yojna, Apsara Apartment, Roop Nagar, Shakti Enclave, Matru Bhumi, Pee Dee Society, Jeevan Vijay, Shree Society, Garden Grove , Garden Grove, Raj Laxmi, Roopkala, Rishikesh, Siddheshwar, Nav Natraj, Spectra Royale, Kripadham, Kamala Voilet Valley, Kamala Presidency , Kamala Primrose. 
The property prices in Borivali West are in the range of 12000 to 15000 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.
Kamala Group currently has 4 Ready Possession, 1 Under Construction projects. 
Garden Grove has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5. 
You can download the brochure of Garden Grove and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website. 
The Bookings for the Ready Possession project Garden Grove are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.
Garden Grove is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.
