 value="60000" placeholder="Enter comparable monthly rent"></div><div class="calc-input-group"><label class="calc-label" for="rvb-appr">Expected appreciation (% p.a.)</label><input type="number" class="calc-input" id="rvb-appr" value="5" step="0.5"></div><div class="rvb-result"><div class="rvb-card rvb-rent"><div class="rvb-val" id="rvb-rent-cost">—</div><div class="rvb-lbl">Monthly Rent Cost</div></div><div class="rvb-card rvb-buy"><div class="rvb-val" id="rvb-buy-cost">—</div><div class="rvb-lbl">Monthly Buy Cost (EMI)</div></div></div><div class="rvb-verdict" id="rvb-verdict"></div></div></div></section><section class="pdp-section"><h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary>What configurations are available at Garden Grove ?</summary><p>Garden Grove offers 2 BHK configurations.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What is the price range at Garden Grove ?</summary><p>Prices at Garden Grove start from approximately Call for Price (indicative only). Contact the developer for final pricing.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Who is the developer of Garden Grove ?</summary><p>Garden Grove is developed by Kamala Group.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>What amenities are available at Garden Grove ?</summary><p>Garden Grove offers amenities including Balcony, Health Club, High speed elevators, Imported Sanitary Fittings, POP finished walls, Granite Platform, Modular Kitchen, Piped Gas, and more.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Where is Garden Grove located?</summary><p>Garden Grove is located in Borivali West, Mumbai.</p></details></div></section><section class="pdp-section" id="market-rates-section"><h2>📊 Property Rates in Borivali West</h2><div class="rate-grid" id="rate-grid"><div class="rate-card" id="rates-loading" style="grid-column:1/-1;padding:24px"><div style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.85rem">⏳ Loading market data...</div></div></div></section><sec