 Capital Gains</a></div></div><style>.featslot{max-width:1180px;margin:1.4rem auto;padding:0 1rem}.featslot-lbl{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#76726b;margin:0 0 9px}.featban{display:flex;background:#16181c;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,.22);border:1px solid #23262b}.featban .fb-img{position:relative;flex:0 0 46%;min-height:200px;background-size:cover;background-position:center;background-color:#1f4d4a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.featban .fb-img .fb-ph{font-size:2.4rem;opacity:.5}.fb-rera{position:absolute;top:11px;right:11px;background:#ffffffe6;color:#0a3d2c;font-family:'Sora';font-weight:600;font-size:.6rem;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.2px}.fb-tag{position:absolute;top:11px;left:11px;background:#a64e2e;color:#fff;font-family:'Sora';font-weight:700;font-size:.6rem;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase}.featban .fb-body{flex:1;padding:20px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;color:#fff}.fb-by{font-family:'Sora';font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem;color:#9aa0a8;margin-bottom:6px}.featban .fb-hl{font-family:'Sora';font-weight:800;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#fff}.fb-sub{font-family:'Sora';font-size:.86rem;color:#c9cdd3;margin-top:9px}.fb-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:15px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;font-family:'Sora';font-weight:600;font-size:.84rem;padding:9px 20px;border-radius:999px;width:fit-content}.featban:hover .fb-cta{background:#1d4fd0}.featcard{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#16181c;border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #23262b;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.featcard .fc-img{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/10;background-size:cover;background-position:center;background-color:#1f4d4a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.featcard .fc-body{padding:14px 16px 16px}.featcard .fc-hl{font-family:'Sora';font-weight:800;font-size:1.15rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.18;margin-top:2px}@media(max-width:640px){.featban{flex-direction:column}.featban .fb-img{flex:none;width:100%;min-height:190px}.featban .fb-hl{font-size:1.3rem}.featban .fb-body{padding:17px 18px}}.newsslot{max-width:1180px;margin:1.6rem auto;padding:0 1rem}.ns-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:11px}.ns-all{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:#a64e2e;text-decoration:none}.ns-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:14px}@media(max-width:640px){.ns-grid{grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:minmax(220px,1fr);overflow-x:auto;grid-template-columns:none;padding-bottom:6px}}.ns-card{display:block;background:#fff;border:1px solid #ece7df;border-radius:13px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(31,30,29,.05);transition:transform .15s,box-shadow .15s}.ns-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 9px 22px rgba(31,30,29,.1)}.ns-img{aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#f3efe8;overflow:hidden}.ns-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.ns-body{padding:11px 13px}.ns-cat{font-family:'Sora';font-size:.64rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#a64e2e}.ns-title{font-family:'Sora';font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:#1f1e1d;line-height:1.25;margin:4px 0 5px}.ns-date{font-size:.72rem;color:#76726b}.reqslot{max-width:1180px;margin:1.6rem auto;padding:0 1rem}.rq-card{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1628,#152a4a);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 26px;color:#fff}.rq-left{flex:1 1 280px}.rq-eyebrow{font-family:'Sora';font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e0bb6a}.rq-hl{font-family:'Sora';font-weight:800;font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.18;margin:7px 0 5px}.rq-sub{font-family:'Sora';font-size:.86rem;color:#c9cdd3}.rq-form{flex:1 1 300px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;max-width:360px}.rq-row{display:flex;gap:9px}.rq-form select,.rq-form input{flex:1;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font:inherit;font-family:'Sora';font-size:.9rem;background:#fff;color:#1f1e1d}.rq-form button{background:#a64e2e;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;font-family:'Sora';font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer}.rq-form button:hover{background:#a64e2e}.rq-msg{display:none;font-family:'Sora';font-size:.9rem;color:#e0bb6a}@media(max-width:640px){.rq-hl{font-size:1.2rem}}</style><section class="reqslot"><div class="rq-card"><div class="rq-left"><div class="rq-eyebrow">🎯 AI Matchmaker</div><div class="rq-hl">Tell us what you want in Borivali West — get matched</div><div class="rq-sub">RERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.</div></div><form class="rq-form" action="/api/requirement" method="post" onsubmit="return mpeReq(this)"><input type="hidden" name="location" value="Borivali West"><input type="hidden" name="mode" value="S"><div class="rq-row"><select name="bhk" aria-label="Bedrooms"><option value="">BHK</option><option>1 BHK</option><option>2 BHK</option><option>3 BHK</option><option>4 BHK</option><option>5 BHK</option></select><select name="budget" aria-label="Budget"><option value="">Budget</option><option>Up to 1 Cr</option><option>1-2 Cr</option><option>2-5 Cr</option><option>5 Cr+</option></select></div><input name="name" placeholder="Your name" aria-label="Your name" autocomplete="name"><input name="mobile" placeholder="Mobile number" aria-label="Mobile number" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="tel" required><button type="submit">Get Matched ›</button><div class="rq-sub" style="font-size:.78rem;opacity:.75">Our advisor replies on WhatsApp within 2 working hours (9am–8pm IST).</div><div class="rq-msg"></div></form></div></section><script>function mpeReq(f){var b=f.querySelector('button'),m=f.querySelector('.rq-msg');b.disabled=true;b.textContent='Sending…'; fetch('/api/requirement',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f)))}) .then(function(r){return r.json()}).then(function(d){m.textContent=d.message;m.style.color=d.success?'#7fe3a4':'#ffd9c9';if(d.success){f.querySelectorAll('input,select,button').forEach(function(e){e.style.display='none'});m.style.display='block';m.style.fontWeight='700'}else{b.disabled=false;b.textContent='Get Matched ›'}}) .catch(function(){m.textContent='Try again or WhatsApp us.';m.style.display='block';b.disabled=false;b.textContent='Get Matched ›'});return false}</script><meta name="mpe-project-id" content="6605"><section class="askmpe" id="askMpe" style="display:none"><div class="am-card"><div class="am-head"><span class="am-eyebrow">💬 Ask MPE</span><span class="am-sub">Answers from MPE + MahaRERA records only — no guesses</span></div><form class="am-form" onsubmit="return askMpe(this)"><input name="question" maxlength="400" placeholder="e.g. What is this builder's delivery track record?" required><button type="submit">Ask</button></form><div class="am-answer" id="amAnswer"></div><div class="am-foot">Prefer a human? <a href="https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%2C%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20Garden%20Grove%20">WhatsApp our advisor</a></div></div></section><style>.askmpe{margin:26px 0}.am-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ece7df;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px}.am-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:10px}.am-eyebrow{font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:#8f3f23}.am-sub{font-size:.78rem;color:#76726b}.am-form{display:flex;gap:8px}.am-form input{flex:1;border:1px solid #e2dccf;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font:inherit;font-size:.9rem}.am-form button{background:#8f3f23;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 22px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.am-form button:disabled{opacity:.6}.am-answer{display:none;margin-top:12px;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;color:#1f1e1d;background:#faf9f5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;white-space:pre-wrap}.am-foot{margin-top:10px;font-size:.78rem;color:#76726b}.am-foot a{color:#18753f;font-weight:600}@media (max-width:520px){.am-form{flex-direction:column}}</style><script>(function(){fetch('/api/ask/status').then(function(r){return r.json()}).then(function(d){if(d.enabled){document.getElementById('askMpe').style.display=''}}).catch(function(){})})(); function askMpe(f){ var b=f.querySelector('button'),out=document.getElementById('amAnswer'); b.disabled=true;b.textContent='Thinking…';out.style.display='none'; var payload={question:f.question.value}; var pid=document.querySelector('meta[name="mpe-project-id"]'); if(pid){payload.project_id=parseInt(pid.content)||null} fetch('/api/ask',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)}) .then(function(r){return r.json()}) .then(function(d){out.textContent=d.answer||d.error||'Try again.';out.style.display='block'}) .catch(function(){out.textContent='Try again in a moment.';out.style.display='block'}) .finally(function(){b.disabled=false;b.textContent='Ask'}); return false; }</script><a href="/ad-click/900040" class="featban" target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored"><div class="fb-img" style="background-image:url('https://pub-e6c778994f1a4c219002a8c17aded350.r2.dev/projects/33860/PHOTO-2026-08-08-12-52-49_thumb.webp')"><span class="fb-tag" style="background:#3a3a3a">Sponsored</span></div><div class="fb-body"><div class="fb-by">New launch</div><div class="fb-hl">Codename Capital World, Thane West</div><div class="fb-sub">New launch in Thane West — ₹14,382/sq.ft</div><span class="fb-cta">View project ›</span></div></a></main><section class="mpe-news-strip"><div class="mns-inner"><div class="mns-head"><h2>📰 Latest Mumbai Property News</h2><a href="/news" class="mns-al